{"seq":1,"slug":"intelligent-measurement-iot","title":"智能测量与物联网","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/intelligent-construction-tech/intelligent-measurement-iot","wordCount":1356,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"智能测量与物联网\">智能测量与物联网</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>施工测量从经纬仪时代跨入卫星定位与无人机遥感时代，物联网传感器则让建筑结构&quot;开口说话&quot;——智能测量与物联网技术共同构成了智能建造的&quot;感知神经系统&quot;，为施工控制和结构监测提供毫米级精度的实时数据支撑。</p>\n<h3 id=\"全站仪与rtk定位技术\">全站仪与RTK定位技术</h3><p>**全站仪（Total Station）**集测角、测距、计算于一体，是施工放样的核心设备。其测距原理基于电磁波传播：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = \\frac{c \\cdot \\Delta t}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为测量距离，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 为光速（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mtext> m/s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 10^8 \\text{ m/s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> m/s</span></span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 为信号往返时间。现代全站仪测角精度达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 1&#x27;&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8352em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（秒），测距精度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm(1mm + 1ppm \\cdot D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mm</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pp</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>**RTK（Real-Time Kinematic）**实时动态定位利用载波相位差分技术，基站与流动站之间建立数据链路：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;GNSS卫星群&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;基准站接收机&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;流动站接收机&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;数据链(UHF/4G网络)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;实时解算坐标&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;施工放样定位&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"GNSS卫星群\"] --&gt; B[\"基准站接收机\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"流动站接收机\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"数据链(UHF/4G网络)\"]\n    D --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; E[\"实时解算坐标\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"施工放样定位\"]</pre><p>RTK平面精度可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm(8mm + 1ppm \\cdot D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mm</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pp</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，高程精度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm(15mm + 1ppm \\cdot D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mm</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pp</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。在开阔场地条件下，固定解初始化时间约10-30秒。</p>\n<p>**网络RTK（CORS系统）**通过区域连续运行参考站网络，消除了自建基站的需求。全国已建成超过4000个CORS站，覆盖主要城市建设区域。</p>\n<h3 id=\"无人机航测与倾斜摄影\">无人机航测与倾斜摄影</h3><p>无人机在施工测量中的典型应用场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n<th>飞行高度</th>\n<th>地面分辨率</th>\n<th>成果类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>土方量计算</td>\n<td>80-120m</td>\n<td>3-5cm</td>\n<td>数字高程模型（DEM）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现场进度记录</td>\n<td>50-80m</td>\n<td>2-3cm</td>\n<td>正射影像（DOM）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>倾斜摄影三维</td>\n<td>60-100m</td>\n<td>2-4cm</td>\n<td>实景三维模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高空构件检测</td>\n<td>20-40m</td>\n<td>1-2cm</td>\n<td>高清影像</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>倾斜摄影三维建模原理</strong>：通过5个镜头（1垂直+4倾斜45°）同步采集多角度影像，经空中三角测量和密集匹配生成点云，再构建三角网格和纹理映射，最终输出真实感三维模型。</p>\n<p>土方量计算精度对比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>方格法</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>h</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{方格法} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} A_i \\cdot \\bar{h}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">方格法</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9812em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为方格面积，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>h</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{h}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9812em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为方格四角平均挖填高度。无人机航测配合DEM可将土方计算误差控制在3%以内，远优于传统方格法的8-10%。</p>\n<h3 id=\"物联网传感器部署\">物联网传感器部署</h3><p>建筑施工和运营阶段的物联网传感器主要监测以下参数：</p>\n<p><strong>应力监测</strong>：振弦式应变计嵌入混凝土构件内部，基于弦振动频率与应力的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma = K \\cdot (f^2 - f_0^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 为标定系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 为当前频率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为初始频率。</p>\n<p><strong>位移监测</strong>：静力水准仪测量差异沉降，LVDT传感器测量裂缝宽度变化，精度可达0.01mm。</p>\n<p><strong>温度监测</strong>：大体积混凝土浇筑时核心温度与表面温度差控制：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta T = T_{core} - T_{surface} \\leq 25°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若温差超限，需启动水冷或覆盖保温措施。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;物联网传感器层&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;数据采集网关&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;边缘计算节点&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;云平台数据中台&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;预警与决策系统&quot;]&#10;&#10;    A --&gt; A1[&quot;应力传感器&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; A2[&quot;位移传感器&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; A3[&quot;温湿度传感器&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; A4[&quot;倾角传感器&quot;]&#10;&#10;    E --&gt; E1[&quot;结构安全评估&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[&quot;施工质量预警&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[&quot;环境超标报警&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"物联网传感器层\"] --&gt; B[\"数据采集网关\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"边缘计算节点\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"云平台数据中台\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"预警与决策系统\"]\n\n    A --&gt; A1[\"应力传感器\"]\n    A --&gt; A2[\"位移传感器\"]\n    A --&gt; A3[\"温湿度传感器\"]\n    A --&gt; A4[\"倾角传感器\"]\n\n    E --&gt; E1[\"结构安全评估\"]\n    E --&gt; E2[\"施工质量预警\"]\n    E --&gt; E3[\"环境超标报警\"]</pre><h3 id=\"北斗高精度定位在施工中的应用\">北斗高精度定位在施工中的应用</h3><p>北斗三号全球卫星导航系统（BDS-3）提供多种精度等级的定位服务：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>公开服务：水平10m，高程10m</li>\n<li>精密单点定位（PPP）：水平分米级</li>\n<li>地基增强（RTK）：水平厘米级</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在智能施工中的典型应用：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>桩基定位</strong>：RTK放样配合全站仪精测，定位精度±5mm</li>\n<li><strong>大型设备导航</strong>：土方机械自动控制，减少超挖欠挖</li>\n<li><strong>塔吊防碰撞</strong>：多塔作业区实时轨迹监控</li>\n<li><strong>边坡变形监测</strong>：毫米级连续观测，预警滑坡风险</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2025-2026年智能测量领域的突破性进展：激光SLAM（同步定位与地图构建）技术已能在10分钟内完成一层楼面的三维扫描并生成BIM级别的竣工模型；无人机RTK免像控技术将航测外业效率提升3倍以上；5G+北斗的高精度时空服务正在多个智慧工地试点应用，实现施工全要素的亚秒级位置感知；基于数字孪生的结构健康监测系统通过AI算法可提前72小时预警结构异常。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>使用全站仪对一栋建筑进行四角坐标放样，记录测量数据并计算闭合差，分析误差来源。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>规划一次无人机航测任务：飞行区域为200m×300m的基坑，要求地面分辨率≤3cm，计算所需飞行高度、航向重叠率和旁向重叠率。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为一座3跨连续梁桥设计物联网监测方案，确定传感器类型、数量和安装位置，画出系统架构图。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较北斗RTK与全站仪在高层建筑竖向投测中的精度和效率，分析各自的适用场景。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本节系统介绍了智能建造中的感知与测量技术体系：全站仪与RTK提供高精度的施工定位能力，无人机航测与倾斜摄影实现大范围快速空间数据获取，物联网传感器网络构建起结构全寿命监测系统，北斗导航则为施工机械和人员提供连续的时空信息服务。这些技术共同构成了智慧工地的数据感知基础层。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"智能测量与物联网","id":"智能测量与物联网"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"全站仪与RTK定位技术","id":"全站仪与rtk定位技术"},{"level":3,"text":"无人机航测与倾斜摄影","id":"无人机航测与倾斜摄影"},{"level":3,"text":"物联网传感器部署","id":"物联网传感器部署"},{"level":3,"text":"北斗高精度定位在施工中的应用","id":"北斗高精度定位在施工中的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"建筑制图与 CAD","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/construction-fundamentals/architectural-drawing-cad"},"next":{"title":"建筑机器人与自动化施工","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/intelligent-construction/intelligent-construction-tech/construction-robotics-automation"}}